==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Donphan|17}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
*'''Exoskeleton''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared as a {{TCG|Poké-BODY}} on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Metapod|87}} from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*'''Land Crush''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Fissure''' on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Brock's Golem|20}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

